 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n              风味：花香、葡萄干、柑橘、蜂蜜、莓果干\n              <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n              Floral, Raisin\n              <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n               ,\n              </span>\n              Citrus, Honeyed, Dried berries\n              <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n               ‍\n              </span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                ‍\n               </span>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n                这是我们的第四支也门豆，也是第二次选到的卢瓦德小农的豆子，与上一次卢瓦德传统日晒不同的是这次是一个特殊处理的炼金术士日晒批次，传统日晒的Ruwad 也门妮娅是很经典的椰枣干葡萄干以及熟茶尾韵，炼金术士这一只入口会有花香复合着柑橘和甜酒感，甚至还会有一些莓果干的调性，中低温时尾韵有很明显的蜂蜜甜香，好舒适～哈哈哈～相比另外两只有更强发酵感的炼金术士，我自己跟喜欢这一只的均衡易饮～\n                <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                 ‍\n                </span>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7SMwshHvmLuFt95wOa4ykO2biaEQwLeobWZz5njtWWJ7tzuwicwjzvedd5bQgXlkbELLjlnukk5AOKA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;width: 677px !important;visibility: visible !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;outline: 0px;color: rgb(178, 178, 178);\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7QpYcpiamRATw60HSf8BOKAv6biaBULMuDK8Blo03ZUPDGnFPmKHKRUGLyzKibLuuH5gd3lwQYBscwgg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible !important;width: 677px !important;\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;text-align: center;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 12px;\">\n                   Yemen-Sana'a(SANAA)-Kharijiya\n                  </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;\"/>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n                  关于Bait Alal村与Hayma地区\n                 </strong>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;\">\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;border-right-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px 0px;\"/>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                   Bait Alal村\n                  </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;text-decoration-style: solid;text-decoration-color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  是也门非常著名的咖啡种植村，它位于Hayma Kharijiya 地区2000米海拔的高山之上，是全球各大咖啡烘焙商青睐的村子，如Square Miles、the Barn、George Howell和蓝瓶子；\n                 </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  卢瓦德合作社服务近290户小农家庭，是2016年生豆商QIMA开启也门精品咖啡对外推广的第一批生产者合作伙伴。\n                  <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n                   ‍\n                  </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Soe8SGCo7iaYhshvaryHP9Hjnh6pI7pP8NibM44ichR4ztNpGGTpicPqicK5Z6jqvViaVXxpKdL8YDKEjQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n                 他们村落的豆子也频频登上Best of Yemen的竞标舞台，去年村里的一个批次位居2022 PCA竞标第九名。\n                </p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n                  Hayma地区\n                 </strong>\n                 是位于萨那省西部的咖啡种植区。8.5万人把海玛称为家，其中至少有1000个家庭在海拔1700-2300米的地方种植咖啡。\n                </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7Soe8SGCo7iaYhshvaryHP9HiaRmutibfraS1IiaK3AUSibCibHWQ0W1lRRPjoSrpk15jXCq5vghOvxeicAg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n                 海玛地区以其温和清新的气候和新鲜的空气而闻名。在这里可以发现一系列蓝色的山脉，比如著名的贾巴尔·沙贾(Jabal al-Shaja)。山上的空气非常清透，你可以在那里看到地平线上的也门全貌。\n                </p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<br/>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n                  关于也门的品种\n                 </strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  大概十年前，是我第一次接触也门的豆子，那个时候记忆里没有什么品种信息，多是以所来自的小区域为名字记忆这款豆子，比如说玛塔莉，哈拉兹，可能唯一跟品种有关的就是也门摩卡，但其实当时那款豆子也不是摩卡品种，更多的是以那个时候的贸易里行销也门的豆子给了一个摩卡的名字，它更像是描述的是摩卡港口，相似的还有巴西的桑托斯等等。\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  再一次见到也门豆，见到品种信息是2018年底，那一年也是我们第一次接触QIMA，一家目前市场上对也门产区最为了解和投入最多的精力推广的咖啡品牌，当时第一次看到每一支咖啡豆上有它的生产者的信息，他的家庭介绍，他的照片以及不同的品种名称，比如说有Udaini, Jaadi, Tufahi, Dawairi等等很绕口都不知道怎么拼读但又充满了神秘感的名字\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RtY0vSKz6qibl2t3R7Fdia4uOJuce5aq2sdhIyNxRciaIenlK7cNRbLMXfLMH0AGYv7tQrGr8ovkFnQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style=\"text-align: start;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  “Family is everything”让我特别感动\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  2020年，由Lavazza，RD2 Vision和QIMA共同成立了一个也门咖啡品种调研的项目，针对也门境内种植的咖啡品种做了一次大摸底，第一次发现并提出也门种植的品种里有一部分是有别于现今世界上其他产区（包括埃塞）的基因谱系，并且将他们命名为New-Yemen既Yemenia家族；\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7RtY0vSKz6qibl2t3R7Fdia4uPzjvKicPDgWLA1iaMPvyiceBwRwoYn9VqcFLHZQUEHHE0ocm3tMn5Nhfg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                   关于处理方式\n                  </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  最初接触咖啡时，从书本和网络上以及听到的是也门的咖啡都是在树上干燥的，因为气候干旱，所以产季时果子成熟后在树上会一直到成干果然后再采收下来，当时就在想，那是个啥画面，直到有机会去到产区，看到果子在树上的实际情况和采收处理晾晒的过程，大概才会觉得之前的那种说法好像没那么靠谱，如果是干果的话，大概率是果子/咖啡树遭受了什么病虫害或者霜冻，导致果子无法完成正常成熟的过程，就逐渐变成干果了，这些干果通常都是不怎么好的果子，里面的咖啡豆本身也不会好；\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RtY0vSKz6qibl2t3R7Fdia4ua02F2W1U3vZJjE90CzyasiaohFuFS3FJH5IqC3JOdaarfUYw7Vh1a7w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-top: 0pt;margin-bottom: 0pt;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;white-space: normal;caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;line-height: 22px;font-size: 11pt;color: rgb(73, 73, 73);'>\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RtY0vSKz6qibl2t3R7Fdia4umh637cORficYG4FZNZLSAwcIdq8EqU9Liavd701eJwbDAOPRPnb22JQQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                  现在，从最新获得的产区资料里，我们知道也门虽然气候干旱，水资源匮乏，但是果子还是可以自然成熟到红果状态，再人工采收下来的，但因为大部分地区水源不丰富，所以也没有水洗处理或者蜜处理的加工方式，全部是日晒或者厌氧日晒的方式，就那我们上面介绍的7款也门来说，其中有，\n                 </span>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style='width: 577.421875px;caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;white-space: normal;text-align: start;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<li style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                    传统日晒，鲜果采收后，运送到晒床进行自然晾晒\n                   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                    深度日晒，鲜果采收后，运送到晒床进行晾晒，相比自然晾晒，果子铺晒的厚度翻倍，过程中仔细控制翻晒频次，让果子缓慢干燥（30天以上）\n                   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<p style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;outline: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-indent: 0em;\">\n                    炼金术士厌氧日晒，鲜果采收后，浮选筛除一些瑕疵果和杂质，然后装入不锈钢发酵罐中，充入二氧化碳，然后咖啡果就进入一个二氧化碳浸渍的厌氧发酵过程；其中根据充入的二氧化碳的多少又有XI，XII和XV的批次区分（XI是充入大量的二氧化碳，最高可达到10psi；XII是完全不充入二氧化碳；XV是充入一定量/少量二氧化碳；发酵结束晾晒时，不同的批次也会有铺晒的厚度不同来再次调控发酵的风味差异，比如说XI的批次里果子铺的厚度比较薄，翻晒的频率比较高；XV的批次果子铺晒的厚度比较厚，翻晒频次低，让其能再晾晒时在下层的果子能继续有一些发酵进行\n                   </span>\n</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n                  更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n                 </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n                  公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n                 </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n                  客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n                  <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
